sequenceDiagram
    participant DSPOperator as Data Science Pipelines<br/>Operator
    participant PipelineComp as Pipeline Component<br/>(e.g. Argo step)
    participant MLMD as MLMD gRPC Server<br/>8080/TCP HTTP/2
    participant MySQL as MySQL/MariaDB<br/>3306/TCP
    participant Consumer as Metadata Consumer<br/>(UI / Pipeline Client)

    Note over DSPOperator,MLMD: Deployment Phase
    DSPOperator->>MLMD: Deploy as companion service<br/>(sidecar or standalone pod)

    Note over PipelineComp,MySQL: Metadata Ingestion Flow
    PipelineComp->>MLMD: PutArtifactType(ArtifactType)<br/>gRPC :8080
    MLMD->>MySQL: INSERT INTO Type<br/>MySQL :3306 (SSL optional)
    MySQL-->>MLMD: type_id
    MLMD-->>PipelineComp: PutArtifactTypeResponse

    PipelineComp->>MLMD: PutExecution(Execution, ArtifactAndEvent[])<br/>gRPC :8080
    MLMD->>MySQL: INSERT INTO Execution, Artifact, Event<br/>MySQL :3306
    MySQL-->>MLMD: execution_id, artifact_ids
    MLMD-->>PipelineComp: PutExecutionResponse

    PipelineComp->>MLMD: PutContexts(Context[])<br/>gRPC :8080
    MLMD->>MySQL: INSERT INTO Context<br/>MySQL :3306
    MySQL-->>MLMD: context_ids
    MLMD-->>PipelineComp: PutContextsResponse

    PipelineComp->>MLMD: PutAttributionsAndAssociations<br/>gRPC :8080
    MLMD->>MySQL: INSERT INTO Attribution, Association<br/>MySQL :3306
    MySQL-->>MLMD: OK
    MLMD-->>PipelineComp: PutAttributionsAndAssociationsResponse

    Note over Consumer,MySQL: Metadata Retrieval & Lineage Flow
    Consumer->>MLMD: GetArtifactsByContext(context_id)<br/>gRPC :8080
    MLMD->>MySQL: SELECT FROM Artifact JOIN Attribution<br/>MySQL :3306
    MySQL-->>MLMD: artifact rows
    MLMD-->>Consumer: GetArtifactsByContextResponse

    Consumer->>MLMD: GetLineageSubgraph(query)<br/>gRPC :8080
    MLMD->>MySQL: Recursive lineage query<br/>MySQL :3306
    MySQL-->>MLMD: lineage graph rows
    MLMD-->>Consumer: GetLineageSubgraphResponse<br/>(artifacts, executions, contexts, events)
